OL,3,GNEWSAMike Nesbitt resigns as health
OL,4,Aminister amid row with UUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Nesbitt has resigned as health
OL,7,Fminister amid a row with the UUP leader
OL,8,FJon Burrows.
OL,10,FThe decision comes following a clash
OL,11,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,12,Fsurgery services from Causeway
OL,13,FHospital.
OL,15,FNesbitt served twice as leader of the
OL,16,Fparty, first from 2012 until 2017 and
OL,17,Fagain from 2024 until earlier this year
OL,18,Fwhen Burrows took over.
OL,20,FBurrows thanked him for his service,
OL,21,Fsaying he "took on arguably the hardest
OL,22,Fjob in government".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
